sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Router as Axum Router<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Handler as Detection Handler
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in PII<br/>Detectors
    participant Custom as Custom Regex<br/>Engine

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Flow 1: Text Content Detection

    Orchestrator->>Router: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>Body: {contents: [...], detectors: {...}}
    Router->>Handler: Route to detection handler

    alt Built-in detector keywords (email, SSN, credit_card)
        Handler->>BuiltIn: Match against hardcoded<br/>PII regex patterns
        BuiltIn-->>Handler: Matches with positions,<br/>type, score=1.0
    end

    alt Custom regex patterns
        Handler->>Custom: Compile and execute<br/>user-supplied regex
        Custom-->>Handler: Matches with positions,<br/>type, score=1.0
    end

    Handler-->>Router: JSON response array<br/>[{start, end, text, detection_type, score}]
    Router-->>Orchestrator: HTTP 200 OK<br/>Detection results

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Health Check Flow

    Orchestrator->>Router: GET /health
    Router-->>Orchestrator: 200 OK "healthy"
